{"id":"ba0eba9b7a6d29a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Omega Distributive Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Omega Distributive Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Omega Distributive Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Omega Distributive Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4c0a39a574d3382\" href=\"?note=e4c0a39a574d3382\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing\">58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> (the first uncountable ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e4c0a39a574d3382\" href=\"?note=e4c0a39a574d3382\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing\">58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}omega\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}omega\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every countable family of dense open subsets has dense intersection.  The top condition and corrected four-place distributivity signature are inherited exactly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"e4c0a39a574d3382","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"e4c0a39a574d3382","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-forcing4-distributive-forcing]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}omega\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10OmegaDistributivePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4DistributiveForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\omega_1)","display":true}],"bytes":1196,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2010","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-omega-distributive-poset]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","e4c0a39a574d3382"]}